#: scenario5:scenario5_92EAF0D5_88BE_4ABB_ACB8_3D6521CAD612
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 85203c4b75a15ca0a95e4170d0a81b8912eb3d12567452d5fd61219cf805023a
