#: scenario5:scenario5_71C02733_EDD7_4D28_AE8B_1E52908A5AAD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3efe149c836f85f330497092e2cc58a1b2cf6321863840dc8c71b6203d644a8e
