msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Возможно... ⟪k:1⟫предлагала.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Не могу сказать, что помню."

#: scenario5:scenario5_5A984C75_4326_4AF7_BE3C_C90A9A04607F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 60f0b6dfaaeea5eea987584699be3093395af4a57255c36180636a74a245c6f9
#. default-sha256: d1892b8bda222fc51dcb06cdc765275ca8f5043e537da85003c5199f09ad875b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5A984C75_4326_4AF7_BE3C_C90A9A04607F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Are you sure about that?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You turned down my proposal, saying I was “wasting my "
